WEBVTT

00:36:59.065 --> 00:37:01.244
maybe the key is just
to give them some skills

00:37:01.268 --> 00:37:03.046
for making that initial introduction,

00:37:03.070 --> 00:37:04.519
then they're going to be fine.

00:37:04.543 --> 00:37:05.699
But for the introvert,

00:37:05.723 --> 00:37:09.231
it's to give them permission
to have a bit of social time

00:37:09.255 --> 00:37:10.407
but then come away.

00:37:10.431 --> 00:37:13.257
SC: Yeah, that's right.
CA: How can you tell the difference?

00:37:13.281 --> 00:37:16.604
SC: Oh, I think, I mean, you can see it
from such early ages.

00:37:16.628 --> 00:37:20.976
You can tell whether
the motivation is anxiety.

00:37:21.000 --> 00:37:25.900
I mean, you can see
the signs of fear on a face

00:37:25.924 --> 00:37:27.941
as you know the child.

00:37:27.965 --> 00:37:30.262
And then there will be some children